    "value": "this be the New Year resolution of suffragists of today. In our hands is the power to bring to a triumphant concl work for the national suffrage amendment which Miss Antho MAY we have the courage and determination to do what is that in 1917 this half-century struggle of women for frecdom shall be ended.",
